---
layout: base.njk
title: "Normandy Tours | Heroes and Heritage Tours"
description: "Juno Beach and Dieppe day tours, plus 2, 3 and 5-day Normandy battlefield journeys covering the American, British and Canadian D-Day sectors."
activeNav: normandy
permalink: "/normandy.html"
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import tourCard %}

<header class="hero hero--compact">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="/photos/juno-paris/juno-paris-cover.jpg" alt="Aerial view of Juno Beach, with the Canadian memorial and preserved bunker in the foreground" width="1800" height="1200">
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Normandy</span>
      <h1>Stand where the Allies landed.</h1>
      <p class="lede">From Juno Beach and Dieppe day tours to multi-day journeys across the full American, British and Canadian D-Day story, and on to Mont-Saint-Michel.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Day tours</span>
      <h2>Explore Juno Beach or Dieppe in a single unforgettable day.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in tours %}{% if tour.normandyRegion and not tour.combo %}{{ tourCard(tour) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt" id="multiDay">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Multi-day tours</span>
      <h2>The complete Normandy experience.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Combine the American, British and Canadian D-Day sectors into one seamless journey, with accommodation recommendations in the historic towns of Bayeux and Caen — or continue on from the Western Front.</p>
    </div>

    {% set multiDaySlugs = ["normandy-2-day", "normandy-3-day", "normandy-explorer-5day", "western-front-normandy-5day"] %}
    {% set multiDayTours = [] %}
    {% for tour in tours %}{% if tour.slug in multiDaySlugs %}{% set noop = multiDayTours.push(tour) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in multiDayTours %}{{ tourCard(tour) }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2>Not sure which tour is right for you?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Send us a message and we'll help you choose the best fit for your trip.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
